      <version name="1.0.1" author="Quaz (EON Studios)" time="2026-09-28T14:45:01Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[The THEME panel gains a NAME BAR row: per instance, show or hide REAPER's own name bar over the plugin's mixer-strip and track-panel embed (hidden by default, as before). A click on the strip closes the plugin's floating window. Digits under 10 px draw regular (bold Arial at 8 and 9 px turns a 5 into a 6), in the plugins and in the link badge. The panel's KNOB chip names the knob actually on screen. 3-Band EQ: the standalone window draws everything at one scale that follows the window, and in a wide, short window the readouts stay clear of the legend.]]></changelog>
